      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5880884689359741021, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Terminal 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682474248818682218, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.name
      value: (scientist research notes)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682474248818682218, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682474248818682218, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: Our current project uses a combination of cutting edge technology and
        a brain-computer interface to connect two objects together and transfer force/velocity
        from one to the other.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682474248818682218, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]
      value: 'The user controls are extremely simple: first, focus intensely on one
        object and then shift your attention to the other.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682474248818682218, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]
      value: "This mimics the way that a user might have clicked on a box and then
        held the mouse button down as they moved the cursor to another box in the
        primitive computer software systems of previous centuries.\t"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8682474248818682218, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]
      value: To release the connection, simply focus (or click, according to my analogy)
        on the second of the two objects.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents:
    - targetCorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 8329055406111076683, guid: c3803ee534f3b3f42b8f8b5cace60ddf, type: 3}
      insertIndex: -1
